The portable Windows build is a Tauri 2 app. The usage window is drawn
by the system WebView2 runtime (Edge), which is not bundled. Tracker
logic, the DPAPI vault, tray, and the OpenAI allowlist run in a native
Rust process.

WebView2 / Edge: Microsoft software, installed with Windows 11 or the
Evergreen WebView2 Runtime. Not shipped in this zip.

Tauri, Wry, and Tao keep their own licenses:
https://github.com/tauri-apps/tauri
